  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering and Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket, the hole of the socket is plated, double-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R1.00 corner relief (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: ISO Enter (courtyard). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
